### How to run: VS Code "REST Client" extension (Send Request link above
### each block), JetBrains IDEs (built-in), `npx httpyac requests.http --all`,
### or copy any body into curl/Postman. Case 9 is intentionally broken JSON,
### CLI tools may need it sent manually.
### Server: http://localhost:3000
### Cases: 1-2 valid, 3 duplicate retry, 4-9 invalid, 10 list store.
### Task version 1.3, 2026-07-14

### 1. Valid payment
POST http://localhost:3000/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "debtorIban": "LV97HABA0012345678910",
  "creditorIban": "LV12PARX0000000000001",
  "reference": "Invoice 42"
}

